# ⚠ DEVELOPMENT SIGNING KEY — PUBLIC BY CONSTRUCTION ⚠
#
# This is the private half of the `dev-2026a` keypair the fixture trust document
# names as an active release key. It lives in a public repository, so anything
# it signs is signed by a key everyone on earth already has.
#
# It exists so the plugin suites can build real signed release documents and
# drive the loader end to end. It MUST NEVER sign a production release. Nothing
# pins it: which keys may sign a release is a document a root signs, and the only
# document that names this one is the fixture the suites build, under the fixture
# root `dev-root-2026a` (`dev-root-key.pem`).
#
# PEM parsers ignore everything before the BEGIN line, so this header costs
# nothing at read time.
-----BEGIN PRIVATE KEY-----
MC4CAQAwBQYDK2VwBCIEIEgSzvnk449Vo881x/l/37JI3CPZ9bVTllC8NACoABGF
-----END PRIVATE KEY-----
